<title>HONG KONG: Midas Printing shrs suspended pending news.</title>
<headline>Midas Printing shrs suspended pending news.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Midas Printing Group Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at HK$0.90 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
